  |CN   | 2022-05-25 | 8.2.3.9 | Compiled in MODGEN 12.1.2.0 using VS2019
				Incremental changes to 8.2.3.8 merge to 8.2.3.8.

						- C1 Introduced ARMAplus(1,1) process and migrated HUI (model 2 and 3) and BMI youth to it. Minor changes and/or renaming of some functions or parameters.
						  - No change in simulated results if UpdateNumberDrinksPastWeekExtra is hooked early (priority 0).  Minor changes if hooked late (priority 50).  Latter may make more sense.
						- C2 Introduced [ARMAPLUS_11_PARAMETERS] classification/dimension to tidy up things.  For instance, former (BmiArmaplus11Phi, BmiArmaplus11Theta, BmiArmaplus11Kappa) --> BmiArmaplus11
						- C2 Introduced siloed uniform process and migrated HUI (model 2 and 3) and BMI youth (partially) to it. Still no change in simulated results if hooked early (see above). 
						  - New parameters: HuiModel2SiloProbs, HuiModel3SiloProbs and BmiSiloProbs.
						  - Following parameters now have [UNIFORM_SILOS] dimension: HuiModel2Armaplus11, HuiModel3Armaplus11 and BmiArmaplus11.  They also all have the [ARMAPLUS_11_PARAMETERS] dimension. 
						- C3 Added input parameters AlcoholSiloProbs and AlcoholArmaplus11 to implement the siloed uniform Alcohol quantile process.
						  - Code fully in place but a few lines are incorrect on purpose so that we can replicate results of previous commits.  See "A few things done to replicate results from POHEM 8238" below.
						- C3 Added input parameters TableFilterAlcohol and TableFilterAlcoholStart.
						- C4 A few last changes
						  - Add input parameter AlcoholUpdateAtStart.
						  - UpdateNumberDrinksPastWeekExtra's hook priority set to 50.   It was 0 before.
						  - Update number_drinks_past_week_extra1 with InvertAlcoholCumulativeHazard(-log(1.0 - alcohol_quantile)) - 1. Previously, InvertAlcoholCumulativeHazard(alcohol_quantile) was used.
						  - alcohol_quantile initiated with alcohol_quantile_startpop  (not with RandUniform(9393)).
						  - Uncommented alcohol_quantile = UpdateSiloedUniform(alcohol_siloed_unif, ... ). 
						 
						Above, C1, C2, C3 and C4 refer to commits 8287d471, 7183ec46, b05f18a0, ??? (final commit of the CN_AlcoholLongitudinal branch). Results from C1, C2 and C3 agree with POHEM 8238.
												   
