  |DH   | 2019-05-31 | 8.2.0.2 | Incremental changes to 8.2.0.1 (modgen 12) | Compiled in MODGEN 12.1.1.0 using VS2015
							
						This is the first draft of the implementation of CVDPoRT in POHEM.
						- CVDPoRT AMI and CVDPoRT Stroke were implemented in 2 new .mpps callend AMI_CVDPoRT.mpp and STROKE_CVDPoRT.mpp respectively.
